X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>Going to college offers a variety of new freedoms\
 , excitements\, and difficulties as students make the transition away fro
 m home. This exhibit features a selection of materials that represents th
 e ways first-year students made Indiana University their second home.</p>
