DESCRIPTION:We'll discuss everything from file organization and naming co
 nventions to writing documentation that future users will understand. We'
 llcover choosingappropriate fileformats\, creating a data dictionary or c
 odebook\, and handling common issues like de-identification and missing d
 ata notes. Participants will leave with a checklist they can apply to the
 ir own data beforesubmittingto a repository.__________  New to research\,
  new to managing your own data\, or interested in learning more about res
 earch data support at IU? Over the course of the Fall 2026 semester\, joi
 n us for webinars designed to walk you through the basics of researching 
