 r requirements and finding the right tools.  Hosted by IU Libraries\, the
  IU Research Data Commons\, and other campus partners\, with sessions use
 ful for researchers at any stage. Some sessions may require advanced regi
 stration.  For any questions\, please contact the IU Libraries Research D
 ata Services team (resdata@iu.edu (mailto:resdata@iu.edu)) - and don't fo
 rget to check back regularly\, as new sessions are added!
