DESCRIPTION:Participants will learn the basics of Tinkercad\, a free brow
 ser-based design tool\, and prepare their creations for printing on the C
 reator Commons' 3D printers.  Please bring your own laptop to participate
 .  Keep in mind that 3D printing takes time\, you may need to return to t
 he Creator Commons to complete your print.  Target Audience: Undergraduat
 e Students  Learning Outcomes:  Create and manipulate simple shapes in Ti
 nkercad  Use slicing software to set up a 3D file to print  Initiate a pr
 int job on the Bambu 3D printers
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Participants will learn the basics of T
 inkercad\, a free browser-based design tool\, and prepare their creations
